ing: By manipulating the XR dashboard, the Commander can boost the user’s visual processing or auditory gain during high-stress moments, effectively “tuning” the user’s brain for the mission.","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"azpE4NMAea"}],"key":"zr08T7lDjv"}],"key":"uQBWFLhAy4"}],"key":"xfneFIXaa2"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the Physician:","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"key":"EE712R2nyS"}],"identifier":"for-the-physician","label":"For the Physician:","html_id":"for-the-physician","implicit":true,"key":"pchZEU84H2"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Precision Diagnostic Suite”","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"key":"zIPUMjHbVw"}],"identifier":"precision-diagnostic-suite","label":"“Precision Diagnostic Suite”","html_id":"precision-diagnostic-suite","implicit":true,"key":"q2oMH7ErTo"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"syGlass Implementation: Enables “Virtual Micro-Slicing.” The Physician can freeze a SciStream live-feed and use syGlass tools to measure the density of neural firing or track electrode degradation in 1:1 scale.","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"key":"IoZ8EBiFnl"}],"key":"B9jWBclfqU"}],"key":"SMXuOvDB23"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Synergy: While inside the syGlass VR environment, the Physician can trigger SciX queries via voice command (e.g., “SciX: Show similar activation patterns in recent epilepsy studies”), with the results appearing as floating windows next to the live 3D brain model.","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"key":"e3b9CxcnEz"}],"key":"XrA4KegR98"}],"key":"FA3LdL0vxQ"}],"key":"lTIHl8fNyO"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Sensory Re-Calibration”","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"key":"TsApnfHvXI"}],"identifier":"sensory-re-calibration","label":"“Sensory Re-Calibration”","html_id":"sensory-re-calibration","implicit":true,"key":"xHD6Ir888d"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tactile Mapping: If a user has lost sensation in a limb, the Physician can use syGlass in XR to manually stimulate specific “dead” zones. By “tapping” a virtual neuron in the XR environment, they send a signal to the NESD to trigger a phantom touch for the user.","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"key":"HQeb0MtJ6l"}],"key":"eSAPcfLo30"}],"key":"PzdLEHyLxl"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pain Suppression: The Physician can identify “pain circuits” (hyper-active clusters) and use an XR interface to “dim” those regions, sending inhibitory signals to provide immediate relief.","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"key":"lPjcIggr10"}],"key":"u3TpbVXcxf"}],"key":"WuDRY4efye"},{"ty